Product Backlog (15)

Epic: Evaluations

As a QA Specialist,
I want to complete evaluations using standardized scorecards,
so that scoring remains consistent.

Acceptance Criteria:

Scorecard loads correctly
Required fields validated
Submission saved automatically

Epic: Coaching

As a Team Leader,
I want to assign coaching sessions,
so that agents can improve performance.

Acceptance Criteria:

Scorecard loads correctly
Coaching sessions created
Follow up coaching sessions set

Epic: Centralized Reporting

As an Operations Manager,
I want to be able to view reports,
so that I gain insights what to do to help the program improve performance.

Acceptance Criteria:

Dashboards load data correctly
Dashboards share the freshest data available every 4 hours
Dashboard users have the option to subscribe to reports they want to automatically get the latest update on, once available
